        "pretty": "∀ {X : Type u_1} {Y : Type u_2} {S : Set X} {P : X → Set Y} {x : X},\n  x ∈ S → pairSupport P ⊆ S → ∀ (s : Set Y), pairSupport (graft P x s) ⊆ S",
